# Packages for the cephfs flavor (Ceph node with an NVMe OSD).
#
# Deliberately NO ceph-mon/ceph-osd/ceph-mgr/ceph-mds RPMs: cephadm deploys those
# as podman containers from quay.io/ceph/ceph (arm64 manifest available). The host
# only needs the bootstrap tool, the client CLI and LVM.

# --- Ceph ----------------------------------------------------------------
cephadm # bootstrap + orchestrate the containerized daemons
ceph-common # ceph/rados/rbd CLI + /usr/bin/mount.ceph (kernel CephFS mounts)
ceph-fuse # FUSE fallback when the kernel client can't be used
ceph-selinux # SELinux policy; Fedora runs enforcing
lvm2 # ceph-volume provisions OSDs as LVM logical volumes
chrony # mon clock skew is a hard failure — time sync is REQUIRED

# --- NVMe / disk tooling -------------------------------------------------
nvme-cli # namespace/format/smart-log for the OSD device
smartmontools # SMART health of the NVMe backing the OSD
gdisk # wipe/inspect GPT before handing a disk to ceph-volume
util-linux # lsblk/wipefs/blkdiscard

# --- Diagnostics you will want at 3am on a storage node ------------------
iotop
sysstat # iostat, mpstat, sar
